        "TileImage": "$($repository 5627a599-0e3a-4ea7-8d96-d42db5adf827).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47 \r\rWe have a contract with Emma Carlisle, who plans to murder her mother-in-law, Alexa, with poison. In order for her plan to work smoothly, Emma has requested that we trim down the staff around the Thornbridge Manor. I have selected five potential targets, all whom may bear witness to Emma&apos;s antics. We must be careful with this contract, as to not panic the Manor, so do it quietly, 47.  \r\r- No sniping\r- No explosives",
